  dialogue:
    name: Monke
    sentences:
    - .....
    - 'I long for the taste of the scrumptious fruit of the yellow variety... It
      hath been many a moon since I have feasted on one... '
    - Alas... I hath endured too much strife in these last few moons... I fear I
      lack the strerngth to make the pilgrimage to procure one...
    - Would you be so kind as to embark upon this journey in my stead? I will pay
      you handsomely for thine troubles.
    quest_check:
    - ...
    - You hath procured me a banana?
    - I shan't ever forget this act of kindness. I thank you graciously.
    - This shall provide sustenance for mine self.
    quest_complete:
    - We meet again....
    - I once again would like to extend my gratitude for procuring me the banana...
    - It hath made this pilgrimage much more bearable...
    - Alas, if only I could find another....
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
