  dialogue:
    name: Magma Slug
    sentences:
    - 'I''ve been craving traditional quaso from my home planet. '
    - "Ah, I can almost taste that crisp, mineral bite of the sea. Refreshing, isn\u2019t
      it?"
    quest_check:
    - Ah, this reminds me of the youthful spirit of my childhood.
    - There you go, thank you for the meal.
    quest_complete:
    - Thank you for reminding me of youthful life in my childhood, ah, the good ol'
      days.
    - I'll definitely recommend you to my superiors.
    choices:
    - 
    - 
