  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f6f9c0723c1c63d45bda37a3070a57a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  searchType: 0
  unitID: 
  hasDialogue: 0
  chatBoxPrefab: {fileID: 2020387750}
  optionBoxPrefab: {fileID: 475889443}
  dialogue:
    name: Monke
    sentences:
    - Ah there you are! I've been searching for you! I'm Monke, I'm your investor!
    - 'You don''t know how to cook! Oh well that''s okay! I can teach you! '
    - You see the rightmost appliance is the sink, where you'll occasionally need
      to chop ingredients into smaller pieces.
    - 'To the left is the fridge. Before you can cook with an ingredient, you''ll
      need to add it to your fridge! If you cant add an ingredient, that most likely
      means that its actually a meal. '
    - The oven is for baking! Here you can bake ingredients such as dough and batter
      into meals!
    - The leftmost station is for mixing! Here you can mix dough together, and occasionally
      make other kinds of meals.
    - Lastly, if you see any red dots on your minimap, it means a customer is approaching!
      Remember to swiftly take their order!
    - This concludes our crash course! For now, try to make a Quaso. Simply mix Cinderwheat
      and Salt together into dough, and bake!
    - Hm? Where can you find Salt? There's a huge geode of the stuff to the south,
      you can't miss it!
    - Oh and I have a twin also named monke that lives around here. Last I heard
      he was lost somewhere in the lava lake, but if you find him, bring him a banana
      please. He hasn't eaten in days....
    quest_check:
